<title>USA: DHL Airways names Guinasso head of U.S. operation.</title>
<headline>DHL Airways names Guinasso head of U.S. operation.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, California 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>DHL Airways said it has promoted Victor Guinasso, who has been with the company for 14 years, to president of the international air express network's U.S. operations.</p>
<p>The appointment is effective immediately.</p>
<p>Guinasso, 41, had been executive vice-president and chief operating officer of DHL Airways, Inc. Before he had been chief financial officer. -Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
